---
import LegalPageLayout from "../layouts/LegalPageLayout.astro";
---

<LegalPageLayout
  title="Refund Policy — Landscape Estimate Pro"
  description="Refund policy for the Landscape Estimate Pro $99 lifetime purchase."
  h1="Refund Policy"
  updated="January 2026"
>
  <h2>Our approach</h2>
  <p>
    If Landscape Estimate Pro doesn't work for your business, contact us within 14 days of purchase using the email
    provided in your purchase receipt and we'll issue a refund. We ask that you tell us what didn't work so we can
    improve the product — but a specific reason isn't required to get a refund within that window.
  </p>

  <h2>How to request one</h2>
  <p>
    Email the address on your receipt with your order details. Refunds are processed back to your original payment
    method through our payment provider and typically appear within a few business days.
  </p>

  <h2>After the window</h2>
  <p>
    Because Landscape Estimate Pro is a one-time lifetime purchase rather than a subscription, requests made well
    after the 14-day window are reviewed case by case rather than guaranteed.
  </p>
</LegalPageLayout>
